# In-place upload diagnostic (27 Nov): BOTS_GFX_HOIST_DIAG=1. Explosions triple the render passes (~580 vs 200-350):
# their uploads stay in place because earlier draws of the submission read the same pages. This records every read
# range of a submission with an XXH3 of its bytes (up to 256 KB) and, at an in-place upload, hashes the overlapping
# ones again: unchanged means moving the upload ahead would have been safe. Logs window totals with the stats and the
# first 16 in-place uploads of each window in detail. Diagnostic only: it hashes every read, so frames get slower.
